---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Affiliate disclosure';
const description = 'How Mailbox Atlas may earn money from links to virtual mailbox providers, and which links are affiliate links.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p><strong>Current status (November 19, 2026): we have no affiliate relationships.</strong> Every provider link goes to the provider's public website, and we earn nothing from it.</p>
  <p>We may apply to affiliate programs run by providers we cover, such as Traveling Mailbox, iPostal1, Anytime Mailbox, PostScan Mail and US Global Mail. If one approves us, links to that provider may become affiliate links, and the provider may pay us a commission at no extra cost to you. We'll list each one here with the date.</p>
  <p>Links that may become affiliate links are marked <span class="aff-tag">affiliate link pending</span> today and carry <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</p>
  <h2>Our rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions never change a price, a fact, or the order of a table.</li>
    <li>If a commission-paying provider is the more expensive choice for a situation, we say so.</li>
    <li>We include providers that don't pay us whenever leaving them out would make a comparison worse.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
